{% set speakingNpc = decnpc(npc.UUID) %}
{% set nearby = get_nearby_actors(npc.UUID) %}
A nearby person ties {{speakingNpc.name}}'s existing leash to a nearby point. The collar stays on; only the free end moves. Not for putting a new leash on.
Available actors: {{ nearby.actorsNameString }}. Never pick anyone not listed.
